{"synopsis":"Sedikit yang saya tahu, saya Chen Hansheng; mantan elit masyarakat dan Sarjana Berlian, terlahir kembali. Ketika saya bangun, saya adalah lulusan senior di sekolah menengah.\n\nKemudian, Chen Hansheng sedang berjalan di dekat penyeberangan, dia tampak ragu-ragu. Seorang gadis yang berharga; Shen Youchu dan dua gadis lainnya; Bai Yueguang dan Xiao Rongyu, siapa yang akan dia pilih? Mereka semua? Salah satu diantara mereka? Dua dari mereka? Baca untuk mengetahuinya.\n\nCatatan Samping: Diamond Bachelor adalah kata slang yang berarti seseorang yang sangat kaya dan lajang.","alternative_title":"我真没想重生啊, I Really Don't Want to Remake, Ta Không Muốn Trùng Sinh Đâu","author":"Pikapi (噼咔噼)","artist":"Pikapi (噼咔噼)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"7d8a67d6-14e6-4379-940d-cf8e914e8b15","number":"477","chapter":"477","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"d4af6d37-1290-451a-aba5-79f0f240a322","number":"476","chapter":"476","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"a136de4c-fa35-451f-9c31-1062e56abb46","number":"475","chapter":"475","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"3d8b7be7-5b4e-4ac8-86ef-9507e58906e1","number":"474","chapter":"474","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"bfc56983-ef85-4589-b552-ce4254c4159e","number":"473","chapter":"473","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"775da2f2-7d5f-4cbc-a1cf-1f2eebbe3d9e","number":"472","chapter":"472","title":"","date":"2026-05-14","released":"2026-05-14"},{"chapter_id":"576a2ef4-cfe9-4664-b913-0c8f52c9b2e2","number":"471","chapter":"471","title":"","date":"2026-05-08","released":"2026-05-08"},{"chapter_id":"1f66ef51-f915-435b-bf93-141489ee5fc9","number":"470","chapter":"470","title":"","date":"2026-05-06","released":"2026-05-06"},{"chapter_id":"85589927-2668-41c0-bec6-ed990851cd84","number":"469","chapter":"469","title":"","date":"2026-05-04","released":"2026-05-04"}